## Auth Architecture

Auth state is managed in `client/context/AuthContext.tsx` via `AuthProvider` + `useAuth()` hook.

### Account type

interface Account {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  email: string;
  initials: string;
  color: string; // unique hex per account
}
```

